        "text": "=You are a strict data extraction tool. You must read ONLY the text provided below and output data matching the required schema. Do not use outside knowledge or make up dates.\n\nText to analyze:\n{{ $json.text_content }}\n\nRules:\n1. Extract the module code found in the text (e.g., \"C240\") into the \"module\" field.\n2. EXCLUDE \"SDCL\" completely.\n3. EXCLUDE any assessment that does not have an explicit week or lesson number stated in the text.\n4. Look ONLY for CA1 and CA2 in the text and list each as an object containing its name and week/lesson date inside the \"assessments\" array.",
